'''HMS ''Saracen''''' was a [[Tribal-class destroyer (1905)|Tribal-class]] [[destroyer]] of the [[Royal Navy]] launched in 1908 and sold in 1919. Originally allocated to the [[1st Destroyer Flotilla]], during the [[First World War]] she served in the [[North Sea]] and the [[English Channel]] with the [[6th Destroyer Flotilla]].

